      "nivel": 2,
      "titulo": "Maintaining a 911 Turbo: from the 930 to the 992, forced induction rules",
      "parrafos": [
        "On a Turbo everything revolves around the turbo: boost pressure, intercooler, the turbo's own cooling and the oil that lubricates it, which works hotter than on a naturally aspirated car. A 930 with a tired turbo and a 992 with a wastegate actuator out of tolerance are different problems with the same root: nobody looked at the forced induction system at the service.",
        "The table covers ten generations, from the four-speed 930 to the 992 Turbo with PDK, at a fixed price with parts and labour. The Turbo shares its body with the Carrera and almost nothing else, and the price takes that into account."
      ],
      "items": [],
